      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) AgentAccount executes protocol calls\nCore state moves to identity-keyed storage (agentKey)\nPayouts route to the active AgentAccount endpoint",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) AgentAccount executes protocol calls\nCore state moves to identity-keyed storage (agentKey)\nPayouts route to the active AgentAccount endpoint",
