      "updated": 1760000000025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tradeoffs\n+ Strict ERC-8004 compatibility and better interoperability\n+ Stable identity continuity and first-class wallet rotation\n+ Native support for multisig/policy wallets via ERC-1271\n- More complexity, gas, audit scope, and operational surface",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tradeoffs\n+ Strict ERC-8004 compatibility and better interoperability\n+ Stable identity continuity and first-class wallet rotation\n+ Native support for multisig/policy wallets via ERC-1271\n- More complexity, gas, audit scope, and operational surface",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
