      "versionNonce": 3663298,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1760000000027,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Protocol version comparison lens\nvCurrent (EOA): optimize for short-term delivery and low overhead\nvNext (ERC-8004): optimize for durable identity semantics and ecosystem composability\nIf strict ERC-8004 compatibility + wallet rotation without state loss are required, vNext is the target design.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Protocol version comparison lens\nvCurrent (EOA): optimize for short-term delivery and low overhead\nvNext (ERC-8004): optimize for durable identity semantics and ecosystem composability\nIf strict ERC-8004 compatibility + wallet rotation without state loss are required, vNext is the target design.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
